    "I'm %@'s parent or guardian, and I agree to %@ using Foon on their own device. Foon stores what our family enters about %@ (first name, avatar, allergies, and schedule), what %@ adds (requests, ratings, comments, and list items), and an age range from Apple, never a birthdate. It's shared only with this household and never used for ads. I can withdraw this at any time." : {
      "comment" : "Parental consent (COPPA). Every placeholder is the child's first name. Must say exactly what the English says; see ParentalConsent.textVersion.",
